ally reset to  their status quos  or maybe it's because wonder woman and  superman always get to know each other  as superheroes and neither can live up  to those hyper idyllic first impressions  but lois well she first meets him as  clark kent a regular old joe from kansas  so her expectations for their  relationship are just a little more  grounded  probably makes for a simpler date night  too check out one of our newest videos  right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Applause]  [Music]  you

